        },
        {
            "language": "typescript",
            "source": [
                "const concept = \"machine learning\""
            ],
            "outputs": []
        },
        {
            "language": "typescript",
            "source": [
                "async function main() {\n    const stream = await openai.chat.completions.create({\n        model: \"gpt-4o\",\n        messages: [\n            {role:\"system\", content: `Create an extensive, tree-like roadmap for learning ${concept} from beginner to expert level. Each node in the tree should represent a significant learning milestone or topic area. The root node should introduce basics of ${concept}. From there, expand into more complex topics that are essential to mastering ${concept}, ensuring each category is broken down into detailed sub-topics where applicable. Each node should have a title and a list of children nodes, indicating the progression of topics to learn. return in a json object`},\n            { role: \"user\", content: prompt_texet}\n        ],\n        response_format: { type: \"json_object\" },  \n        stream: true,\n    });\n    for await (const chunk of stream) {\n        process.stdout.write(chunk.choices[0]?.delta?.content || \"\");\n    }\n}\n\nmain();"
            ],
            "outputs": []
        },
